####################### adding advisors

@add_advisors
title: Add advisors
choose-if: n_advisors < 3
unavailable-subtitle: Maximum of 3 advisors.
go-to: advisor_menu

@advisor_menu
title: Add other advisors.
tags: besteiristas_advisor, caballeristas_advisor, prietistas_advisor
frequency: 1


- @prietistas: Add Prietistas
- @caballeristas: Add Caballeristas
- @besteiristas: Add Besteiristas
- @rm_main: Remove advisors instead.
- @remove_none: Stop changing advisors.

@prietistas
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #prietistas_advisor

@besteiristas
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #besteiristas_advisor

@caballeristas
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #caballeristas_advisor

# Besteiristas
@add_besteiro
title: Julián Besteiro
subtitle: Besteiro is a prominent professor, leader of the reformist wing of the PSOE and president of the UGT Union.
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/besteiro.jpg
tags: besteiristas_advisor
view-if: besteiro_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: besteiro_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; besteiristas_strength += 5
go-to: advisor_menu

Julián Besteiro is now an advisor.

# Prietistas
@add_prieto
title: Indalecio Prieto
