card-image: img/portraits/delosrios.jpg
tags: prietistas_advisor
view-if: delosrios_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: delosrios_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; prietistas_strength += 5
go-to: advisor_menu

Fernando de los Ríos is now an advisor.

